# Embers Isle's lava tube (CIPlay embers_isle_cave, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the recipe: the
# new knoll hw_mount at -18 -20 (b 14, h 18); 11-17: kit_dig mouth on its EAST foot at -6.5 -20 (yaw 270: way in = -x),
# 9 m level, a 4 m room to -19.5 -20; the sign eitubesign at -0.5 -25.5; a boar (eiboar) and a rat (eirat) inside; zone
# ei_tube at -14 -20. The hunters' boars outside are not killed (kill takes every boar).
# 11-17 w14E: in-cave pictures at absolute heights - a '+h' height is taken over the hill's top, so the camera (and the player) stood on the hill.
island Embers Isle keep
offset 0.3501 -1.8994
hour 11
weather Calm

# The knoll and the mouth from the valley under the ridge
picture ei_tube_out -2 +2 -23 -6.5 +1.5 -20
read scratched on a board

# The cave's animals (11-12 mixed monsters): a boar and a rat, both inside - they wait until a player is in the
# passage (zone ei_wake at -9 -20; 11-17 w14E: the boar roamed out of the mouth before the player came)
walk -4 -21 to -6.5 -20 to -9 -20
wait 3
expect animalsinside Warthog 1
expect animalsinside Rat 1
kill Rat
expect animalsinside Rat 0

# In along the tube to the chamber (the boar is left alive: it attacks)
walk -9 -20 to -10 -20 to -14 -20
zone ei_tube
picture ei_tube_in -9 9.6 -20 -19 7.6 -20 light=20
walk -14 -20 to -10 -20 to -6.5 -20 to -4 -21
